     These functions may fail with the following errors:

     [ELF_E_ARGUMENT]  Arguments _d_a_t_a or _d_y_n were NULL.

     [ELF_E_ARGUMENT]  Argument _n_d_x was less than zero or larger than the num‐
                       ber of entries in the data descriptor.

     [ELF_E_ARGUMENT]  Data descriptor _d_a_t_a was not associated with a section
                       of type SHT_DYNAMIC.

     [ELF_E_RANGE]     A value was not representable in the target type.

     [ELF_E_VERSION]   The _E_l_f___D_a_t_a descriptor denoted by argument _d_a_t_a is as‐
                       sociated with an ELF object with an unsupported ver‐
                       sion.

